@startuml
[*] --> Monitoring

Monitoring : System monitoring for entries and suspicious devices

Monitoring --> EntryDetected : on entry detected
Monitoring --> ReminderNotification : on user forgets to enter

EntryDetected : Entry detected and notification sent
EntryDetected --> SuspiciousDeviceDetected : on suspicious device detected
EntryDetected --> Monitoring : on no suspicious device

SuspiciousDeviceDetected : Suspicious device detected and notification sent
SuspiciousDeviceDetected --> Monitoring : on device removed

ReminderNotification : Reminder notification sent
ReminderNotification --> ResetEntryTimes : on reset requested

ResetEntryTimes : Resetting entry times
ResetEntryTimes --> Monitoring : on reset completed

Monitoring --> [*]
@enduml
